# Wipe logs after every ship (Quest Tracker only)

**Quest Tracker Reduxx ships only.** Pawn Companion uses `re2_framework_log.txt` — do not run `_wipe_game_logs.ps1` for PC.

After QT version bump + ship, run `_wipe_game_logs.ps1 -Version X.Y.Z` (truncate, never delete). See script for paths.
